  <h1>Status &amp; coverage</h1>
  <p style="margin:0;max-width:620px">What is in the current edition, how fresh it is, and what we know is imperfect about it. Generated automatically from the published dataset — this page cannot drift from reality.</p>
</div></header>
<div class="wrap">
  <div class="band">
    <div class="cell"><div class="n g">27,975</div><div class="k">domains parsed this edition</div></div>
    <div class="cell"><div class="n">50,000</div><div class="k">Tranco frame</div></div>
    <div class="cell"><div class="n">28,011</div><div class="k">per-domain rows published</div></div>
    <div class="cell"><div class="n">54</div><div class="k">ccTLD editions</div></div>
  </div>
  <table>
    <tr><th>Item</th><th>Value</th></tr>
    <tr><td>Edition generated</td><td class="mono">2026-08-17T23:26:13.299Z</td></tr>
    <tr><td>Age</td><td class="mono ok">2.3 days (within the weekly cycle)</td></tr>
    <tr><td>Methodology version</td><td class="mono">2026-08-10.1</td></tr>
